stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING: scan saved while offline
  PENDING --> SYNCING: connection back, POST /api/sync
  SYNCING --> SUCCESS: server verified the QR
  SYNCING --> FAILED: server rejected (invalid, expired, used...)
  SYNCING --> PENDING: network lost again, retry later
  SUCCESS --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
